---
const { locale } = Astro.props;
---
<section id="content-editor" data-locale={locale} hidden>
	<h2>{locale === "zh" ? "内容管理" : "Content management"}</h2>
	<p class="editor-note">保存后自动构建网站，通常需要约一分钟。草稿不会显示在网站，但公开仓库中的原始文件可被读取。</p>
	<nav class="editor-tabs" aria-label="编辑内容">
		<button type="button" data-tab="articles">文章 / Articles</button>
		<button type="button" data-tab="projects">项目 / Projects</button>
		<button type="button" data-tab="about">关于 / About</button>
		<button type="button" data-tab="settings">站点名称 / Site title</button>
	</nav>
	<p id="editor-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
	<div data-panel="articles">
		<div class="editor-row"><select id="article-list" aria-label="选择文章"><option value="">新建文章 / New article</option></select><button id="new-article" type="button">新建</button><button id="refresh-articles" type="button">刷新列表</button></div>
		<form id="article-form">
			<div class="editor-row"><label>语言 <select name="locale"><option value="zh">中文</option><option value="en">English</option></select></label><label>文件名 <input name="slug" required pattern="[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{0,79}" placeholder="my-first-post" /></label></div>
			<label>标题 <input name="title" required maxlength="120" /></label>
			<label>摘要（10–160 字） <textarea name="description" required minlength="10" maxlength="160" rows="2"></textarea></label>
			<div class="editor-row"><label>发布日期 <input name="publishDate" type="date" required /></label><label>分类 <input name="category" required maxlength="50" value="笔记" /></label></div>
			<label>标签（用逗号分隔） <input name="tags" placeholder="算法, python" /></label>
			<label>中英文关联键（可选） <input name="translationKey" maxlength="100" /></label>
			<label class="editor-check"><input name="draft" type="checkbox" /> 保存为草稿 / Draft</label>
			<label>正文（Markdown） <textarea name="body" rows="20" class="markdown-body" maxlength="100000"></textarea></label>
			<div class="editor-row"><button type="submit">保存文章</button><button id="delete-article" type="button" disabled>删除文章</button></div>
		</form>
	</div>
	<div data-panel="projects" hidden>
		<p>编辑项目资料；新增和移除项目将在保存列表后生效。</p>
		<div id="project-items"></div><button id="add-project" type="button">新增项目</button> <button id="save-projects" type="button">保存项目列表</button>
	</div>
	<div data-panel="about" hidden>
		<label>语言 <select id="about-locale"><option value="zh">中文</option><option value="en">English</option></select></label>
		<label>关于正文（Markdown） <textarea id="about-body" rows="20" maxlength="100000" class="markdown-body"></textarea></label>
		<button id="save-about" type="button">保存 About</button>
	</div>
	<div data-panel="settings" hidden>
		<label>网站名称 <input id="site-title" maxlength="60" required /></label>
		<p class="editor-note">修改的是网站显示名称，仓库名称和网址保持不变。</p>
		<button id="save-settings" type="button">保存站点名称</button>
	</div>
</section>
<style>
	#content-editor { margin: 40px 0; }
	h2 { font-size: 23px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
	.editor-tabs, .editor-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
	label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 18px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 13px; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
	input, textarea, select { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 4px; background: hsl(var(--theme-bg)); color: hsl(var(--theme-text)); font: inherit; box-sizing: border-box; }
	textarea { resize: vertical; }
	button { padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 4px; background: var(--accent-soft); color: hsl(var(--theme-text)); cursor: pointer; font: 13px var(--font-sans); }
	button:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: wait; }
	.editor-check { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; }
	.editor-check input { width: auto; }
	.markdown-body { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
	.editor-note, #editor-status { font: 13px/1.8 var(--font-sans); color: hsl(var(--theme-text-muted)); }
	:global(.project-card) { border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 4px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
	:global(.project-card label) { display: block; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
	:global(.project-card input), :global(.project-card textarea) { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline); background: hsl(var(--theme-bg)); color: hsl(var(--theme-text)); font: inherit; box-sizing: border-box; }
</style>
<script>
import { initContentEditor } from "../scripts/content-editor";
initContentEditor();
</script>
